    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "Petitioner has sought quashing of F.I.R. No.16 of 2021, registered against him for offence punishable under Section 323, 420, 452, 504 & 506 I.P.C. in Police Station Nanakmatta, District Udham Singh Nagar.",
