        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "Whether the allegations are true or untrue, would have to be decided in the trial.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 1937,
      "end": 2019,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.21401990950107574
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "While exercising power under Article 226 of the Constitution, this Court is not expected to embark upon an enquiry into, whether there is reliable evidence or not.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 2020,
      "end": 2183,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Article 226",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2049,
          "end": 2060
        },
        {
          "text": "Constitution",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 2068,
          "end": 2080
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.35136473178863525
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "It is not a case where FIR does not, disclose any offence.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2184,
      "end": 2242,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5055286288261414
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "None of the parameters laid down by Hon'ble Supreme Court, for invoking power under Article 226 of the Constitution for quashing an FIR, are met in the present case.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2243,
      "end": 2408,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Supreme Court",
          "label": "COURT",
          "start": 2287,
          "end": 2300
        },
        {
          "text": "Article 226",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2327,
          "end": 2338
        },
        {
          "text": "Constitution",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 2346,
          "end": 2358
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.45100587606430054
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "7. In such view of the matter, there is no scope for interference with the impugned FIR while exercising extraordinary power under Article 226 of the Constitution.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2409,
      "end": 2573,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Article 226",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2541,
          "end": 2552
        },
        {
          "text": "Constitution",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 2560,
          "end": 2572
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.45328086614608765
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "8. Accordingly, the writ petition fails and is dismissed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 2575,
      "end": 2632,
